{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "38348530",
      "title": "Handling Events",
      "sourceHash": "a88f3954babed7f4c69e156bae746252abec00311ace0b608e0faa60656e989b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 3.33,
          "en": "Now, the next task",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.33,
          "end": 8.25,
          "en": "is to handle the Submit and Reset button click events.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.25,
          "end": 9.18,
          "en": "And for that, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.18,
          "end": 12.27,
          "en": "we'll need to make sure that whenever these events occur,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.27,
          "end": 15.543,
          "en": "some code of our choice is getting executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.22,
          "end": 20.58,
          "en": "So therefore, I'm back in the UserInput.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.58,
          "end": 23.1,
          "en": "because that's where I got this form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.1,
          "end": 24.87,
          "en": "And of course, I wanna, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.87,
          "end": 26.77,
          "en": "listen to the submission of that form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.84,
          "end": 30.15,
          "en": "We can do that, as you learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.15,
          "end": 35.15,
          "en": "by adding the onSubmit prop to this built-in form element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.4,
          "end": 37.2,
          "en": "to this built-in form component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.2,
          "end": 39,
          "en": "which it is in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39,
          "end": 42.09,
          "en": "And then, we can define a function inside of a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.09,
          "end": 45.303,
          "en": "which you can do in JavaScript as you learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.44,
          "end": 47.28,
          "en": "and for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.28,
          "end": 52.05,
          "en": "add our submitHandler function like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.05,
          "end": 53.74,
          "en": "That's one way of writing it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.2,
          "end": 60.2,
          "en": "and we can now set this as a value for onSubmit, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.172,
          "end": 64.92,
          "en": "So, submitHandler is passed as a value to onSubmit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.92,
          "end": 68.76,
          "en": "and what's important here is that we don't add parentheses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.76,
          "end": 71.28,
          "en": "because we don't want to execute this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.28,
          "end": 73.83,
          "en": "when this line of code is being parsed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.83,
          "end": 76.95,
          "en": "Instead, we want to pass it as a value to onSubmit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.95,
          "end": 78.63,
          "en": "so that in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.63,
          "end": 82.53,
          "en": "React internally can trigger this function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.53,
          "end": 85.263,
          "en": "whenever this form here is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.49,
          "end": 90.09,
          "en": "Now, when it comes to handling form submissions in React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.09,
          "end": 94.08,
          "en": "it is quite common that we wanna prevent the default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.08,
          "end": 97.74000000000001,
          "en": "which we can do by accepting the event argument here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.74000000000001,
          "end": 101.00999999999999,
          "en": "which will be passed in automatically by React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.00999999999999,
          "end": 103.28999999999999,
          "en": "when that event occurs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.28999999999999,
          "end": 105,
          "en": "And on that event object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105,
          "end": 107.31,
          "en": "we can call preventDefault",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.31,
          "end": 110.85,
          "en": "to make sure that the browser's default behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.85,
          "end": 112.68299999999999,
          "en": "is prevented and blocked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.61,
          "end": 117.87,
          "en": "because that default behavior would be to reload the page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.87,
          "end": 119.61,
          "en": "which we don't want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.61,
          "end": 122.46,
          "en": "because that would reload and therefore in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.46,
          "end": 126.909,
          "en": "restart the React application, which we don't want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126.909,
          "end": 129.57,
          "en": "So therefore, we are preventing that default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.57,
          "end": 132.87,
          "en": "so that the page does not get reloaded and instead,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.87,
          "end": 136.53300000000002,
          "en": "our JavaScript code continues to execute and takes over.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.57999999999998,
          "end": 140.31,
          "en": "And here, we'll then have to do something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.31,
          "end": 142.293,
          "en": "once the form was submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.67000000000002,
          "end": 147,
          "en": "Now, I'll get back to that do something here soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147,
          "end": 149.82,
          "en": "But before we do something here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.82,
          "end": 151.62,
          "en": "I want to add another function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.62,
          "end": 153.663,
          "en": "which would be the resetHandler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 154.86,
          "end": 157.26,
          "en": "because we also want to handle the scenario",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.26,
          "end": 160.113,
          "en": "that this reset button here was clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 161.37,
          "end": 164.34,
          "en": "That's why I'm adding this resetHandler function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.34,
          "end": 167.13,
          "en": "because it's now this resetHandler function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 167.13,
          "end": 169.53,
          "en": "that can be assigned as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.53,
          "end": 172.773,
          "en": "to the onClick prop on this reset button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 174.32999999999998,
          "end": 178.5,
          "en": "We don't set the onClick prop on this calculate button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 178.5,
          "end": 180.96,
          "en": "because this button is of type submit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 180.96,
          "end": 183.063,
          "en": "and therefore will submit the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 183.93,
          "end": 187.32,
          "en": "and therefore will lead to this event being triggered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 187.32,
          "end": 191.73,
          "en": "But we do set resetHandler as a value on this reset button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 191.73,
          "end": 194.01,
          "en": "so that when this button is clicked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 194.01,
          "end": 195.69,
          "en": "we don't submit the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 195.69,
          "end": 197.64,
          "en": "but instead we reset it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 197.64,
          "end": 200.973,
          "en": "and we reset all input values to their defaults.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 202.29,
          "end": 203.76,
          "en": "Now, of course, we're also going",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 203.76,
          "end": 206.52,
          "en": "to add some logic for this soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 206.52,
          "end": 207.353,
          "en": "For the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 207.353,
          "end": 208.71,
          "en": "we just added the function though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 208.71,
          "end": 210.453,
          "en": "and connected it to the handler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 211.32,
          "end": 213.47,
          "en": "And we can simply console.log('RESET') here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 214.71,
          "end": 216.333,
          "en": "to see whether this works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 217.74,
          "end": 221.853,
          "en": "and console.log('SUBMIT') here in the submitHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 223.38,
          "end": 226.2,
          "en": "With that, if you go back to your website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 226.2,
          "end": 228.663,
          "en": "and you open the browser developer tools,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 229.56,
          "end": 231.99,
          "en": "you should see that if you click reset,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 231.99,
          "end": 234.663,
          "en": "it says RESET here in the console,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 235.74,
          "end": 238.02,
          "en": "and if you instead click calculate,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 238.02,
          "end": 239.583,
          "en": "it says SUBMIT.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 241.05,
          "end": 243.573,
          "en": "So those event handlers are working,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 245.43,
          "end": 250.32,
          "en": "but these aren't the only event handlers you need to add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 250.32,
          "end": 253.86,
          "en": "Instead, we also got all these input elements here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 253.86,
          "end": 257.01,
          "en": "and even though we're not managing state yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 257.01,
          "end": 260.76,
          "en": "we'll soon have to manage the values entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 260.76,
          "end": 262.83,
          "en": "by the user as state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 262.83,
          "end": 266.37,
          "en": "and we'll have to listen to changes to those inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 266.37,
          "end": 268.8,
          "en": "to update the managed state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 268.8,
          "end": 271.89300000000003,
          "en": "So, to save the values entered by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 273.65999999999997,
          "end": 274.8,
          "en": "And therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 274.8,
          "end": 279.45,
          "en": "we can also add the onChange event to all these inputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 279.45,
          "end": 282.3,
          "en": "and then define a function that should be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 282.3,
          "end": 285.09000000000003,
          "en": "when that change event occurs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 285.09000000000003,
          "end": 288.693,
          "en": "so when the user changes the value in an input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 289.74,
          "end": 291.48,
          "en": "For that, I'll add a new function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 291.48,
          "end": 293.283,
          "en": "which I'll name changeHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 294.27,
          "end": 295.86,
          "en": "And what I'm doing here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 295.86,
          "end": 298.23,
          "en": "is I'm defining one function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 298.23,
          "end": 301.773,
          "en": "which I then plan to use for all my inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 302.7,
          "end": 306.99,
          "en": "So, I'll set up a generic eventHandler function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 306.99,
          "end": 310.92,
          "en": "which I want to reuse for multiple events of the same kind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 310.92,
          "end": 312.603,
          "en": "from different sources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 314.1,
          "end": 315.21,
          "en": "For this here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 315.21,
          "end": 319.473,
          "en": "in this changeHandler or this inputChangeHandler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 320.52,
          "end": 322.62,
          "en": "the name, of course, is up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 322.62,
          "end": 325.95,
          "en": "I'll expect to get two parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 325.95,
          "end": 330.95,
          "en": "The first identifier should identify the event source,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 331.8,
          "end": 335.433,
          "en": "so in this case, the input for which this event occurred.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 336.93,
          "end": 340.773,
          "en": "The second value should then be the value that was entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 341.61,
          "end": 342.443,
          "en": "And with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 342.443,
          "end": 344.90999999999997,
          "en": "we cannot use inputChangeHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 344.90999999999997,
          "end": 347.90999999999997,
          "en": "in conjunction with the onChange prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 347.90999999999997,
          "end": 352.53,
          "en": "Though we can't set it as a value like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 352.53,
          "end": 353.76,
          "en": "or to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 353.76,
          "end": 357.843,
          "en": "we could but we would then not get this information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 359.37,
          "end": 363.24,
          "en": "Instead, I'll create an anonymous arrow function down here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 363.24,
          "end": 365.55,
          "en": "as a value for onChange,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 365.55,
          "end": 370.55,
          "en": "and in this arrow function I'll execute inputChangeHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 370.74,
          "end": 373.32,
          "en": "So here, we now need these parentheses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 373.32,
          "end": 376.98,
          "en": "to call this inputChangeHandler function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 376.98,
          "end": 379.53,
          "en": "but this function will now not be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 379.53,
          "end": 382.02,
          "en": "when this line of code here is being parsed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 382.02,
          "end": 386.58,
          "en": "but instead only when this arrow function will be executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 386.58,
          "end": 388.62,
          "en": "And this arrow function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 388.62,
          "end": 391.65,
          "en": "since it's passed as a value to onChange,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 391.65,
          "end": 395.37,
          "en": "will only be executed by React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 395.37,
          "end": 397.89300000000003,
          "en": "whenever the value in this input changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 398.88,
          "end": 400.8,
          "en": "So therefore, indirectly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 400.8,
          "end": 404.22,
          "en": "inputChangeHandler will only be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 404.22,
          "end": 406.14300000000003,
          "en": "when the input value changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 407.43,
          "end": 411.51,
          "en": "But since we now control the execution of inputChangeHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 411.51,
          "end": 416.1,
          "en": "or to be precise, we control how it will be executed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 416.1,
          "end": 421.1,
          "en": "we can now also pass some data here to inputChangeHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 421.74,
          "end": 424.68,
          "en": "And the first piece of data, the first argument,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 424.68,
          "end": 427.98,
          "en": "should be this identifier of this input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 427.98,
          "end": 430.473,
          "en": "so that value should be provided.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 432.06,
          "end": 434.34,
